GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/email/verify/27/276b9ddd427a70f11d76ef8ec0e2a666410d1e78?expires=1750504869&signature=351ee110df276af3508f480b473100e9e77f00e2e89bfa8fdc90f662079c81b9 HTTP/1.1
